    {
      "id": "python-concurrency-network-asyncio-c01",
      "type": "code",
      "prompt": "读取非空文本并去掉首尾空白。普通文本通过本地 async render 协程转大写；文本恰好为 cancel 时创建任务并取消，捕获 CancelledError 后输出 cancelled。其他文本包括 __invalid__ 均按普通文本处理。空白输入无输出，退出码 1。使用 asyncio.run、await，不发请求；支架已读取 text。",
      "starter_code": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nimport asyncio\nif not text:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\n# 按题面实现本课操作\n",
      "visible_tests": [
        "输入 'hard'，输出 'HARD\\n'，退出码 0。",
        "输入 'cancel'，输出 'cancelled\\n'，退出码 0。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 15,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nimport asyncio\nif not text:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nasync def render(value):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0)\n    return value.upper()\nasync def main(value):\n    if value == \"cancel\":\n        task = asyncio.create_task(render(value))\n        task.cancel()\n        try:\n            await task\n        except asyncio.CancelledError:\n            return \"cancelled\"\n    return await render(value)\nprint(asyncio.run(main(text)))\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "检查题面规定的有效边界和失败行为。",
          "输出格式、类型和顺序以题面约定为准。"
        ],
